bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Genre Management UI" as UI
boundary Router
control GenreController
control ValidationPipe
control GenreService
entity GenreModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Click "Update" on genre row
activate Admin
activate UI

Admin -> UI: 2. Modify fields + submit update

UI -> Router: 3. PATCH /genre/{id}
activate Router

alt Token invalid
    Router --> UI: 3.1.1. 401 Unauthorized
    UI --> Admin: 3.1.2. Show error message
else Role invalid
    Router --> UI: 3.2.1. 403 Forbidden
    UI --> Admin: 3.2.2. Show error message
end
Router -> GenreController: 4. update(id, dto)
activate GenreController

GenreController -> ValidationPipe: 5. Validate UpdateGenreDto
activate ValidationPipe

opt Validation failed
    ValidationPipe --> GenreController: 5.1. Throw 400 error
    GenreController --> Router: 5.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 5.3. Validation error
    UI --> Admin: 5.4. Show error message
end
ValidationPipe --> GenreController: 6. DTO valid
deactivate ValidationPipe

GenreController -> GenreService: 7. updateGenre(id, dto)
activate GenreService

opt Invalid ObjectId
    GenreService --> GenreController: 7.1. Throw BadRequest
    GenreController --> Router: 7.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 7.3. Invalid ID error
    UI --> Admin: 7.4. Show error message
end
GenreService -> GenreModel: 8. findByIdAndUpdate(id, dto, {new:true})
activate GenreModel
GenreModel -> MongoDB: 9. Update document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> GenreModel: 10. Return result
deactivate MongoDB
GenreModel --> GenreService: 11. Return result
deactivate GenreModel
opt Not found
    GenreService --> GenreController: 11.1. Throw NotFound
    GenreController --> Router: 11.2. HTTP 404 response
    Router --> UI: 11.3. Not found error
    UI --> Admin: 11.4. Show error message
end
                
GenreService --> GenreController: 12. Updated genre
deactivate GenreService
GenreController --> Router: 13. HTTP 200 response
deactivate GenreController
Router --> UI: 14. Return updated genre
deactivate Router
UI --> Admin: 15. Update success
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin

@enduml